'''{{PAGENAME}}''' is a cape in ''[[Helldivers 2]]''.

== Acquisition ==
This cape is currently unavailable to all Helldivers.

This [[Cosmetics#Capes and Cards|cape]] was intended to be given out to any Helldivers who partook in the [[Campaigns#Blazing Electorate|Blazing Electorate Campaign]]. However, with the campaign ending in a failure, this did not happen.

== Trivia ==
* The {{PAGENAME}} cape is the first Campaign Reward to not be given out, due to [[Campaigns#Blazing Electorate|Operation: Blazing Electorate]] ending in a failure.
** While it is possible for it to return at a later date, this is unconfirmed.

